          "from": "manteiga /mɐ̃ˈtejɡɐ/ 'butter'",
          "to": "[mɐ̃ˈteɡɐ]",
          "note": "Also roupeiro [ʁoˈpeɾu], bandeira [bɐ̃ˈdeɾɐ]; final -ei (rei, lei) keeps the diphthong."
        }
      ],
      "isAllophone": true,
      "context": "Before palatals and other consonants, in northern and vernacular speech"
    },
